i16 %indvar = #xfff4 (65524, -12)
i16 %add = #xffe8 (65512, -24)
i32 %ext = #x0000ffe8 (65512)
i16 %indvar.next = #xfff5 (65525, -11)
  >> Jump to %for.end

Target:
  >> Jump to %for.body
  >> Jump to %for.end
Source value: #x0000ffe8 (65512)
Target value: #x0001ffe8 (131048)

Summary:
  0 correct transformations
  1 incorrect transformations
  0 failed-to-prove transformations
  0 Alive2 errors

